infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Three naming-drift signals — each a different model defect
  desc Drift is a diagnostic: every signal points to a distinct fix, not a rename
  lists
    - label A word starts needing qualifiers
      desc Sales Order vs Billing Order — one term, two meanings. Defect: a misplaced context boundary. Fix: split the bounded context, not rename.
    - label One concept, different names per artifact
      desc ProposalDraft in code, Quote in conversation, pending_order in the DB. Defect: model does not match the team's language. Fix: rename toward the language.
    - label Experts say a word the code lacks
      desc Approval escalation lives in conversation but has no class, method, or event. Defect: a missing concept. Fix: add it to the code.
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b
